@startuml C3_VVE_Update_Process_View
title C3 – VVE Update (Process Flow)

skinparam ParticipantFontStyle bold
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
participant "VveDetailsComponent" as UI
participant "OemVveService" as FrontService
participant "VveProxyController" as Proxy
participant "EtagValidator" as Etag
participant "OemClient" as Client
participant "OEM VveController" as OemController
participant "VveUpdateService" as UpdateService
participant "ConcurrencyGuard" as Concurrency
participant "DockDiscrepancyChecker" as Discrepancy
Database "VVN Store" as VvnDb
participant "VveRepository" as VveRepo
Database "VVE Store" as VveDb
participant "AuditPublisher" as Audit
Database "Audit Store" as AuditDb
component "Audit Topic" as AuditTopic

Operator -> UI : Change berth time & dock
UI -> FrontService : save()
FrontService -> Proxy : PATCH
Proxy -> Etag : Validate version header
Etag --> Proxy : ok
Proxy -> Client : Forward request with JWT
Client -> OemController : PATCH /vves/{id}
OemController -> UpdateService : updateVve
UpdateService -> Concurrency : ensureLatestVersion
Concurrency -> VveRepo : load VVE
VveRepo --> Concurrency : current version
Concurrency --> UpdateService : ok
UpdateService -> Discrepancy : compare planned dock
Discrepancy -> VvnDb : load planned dock
VvnDb --> Discrepancy : dock id
Discrepancy --> UpdateService : warnings[]
UpdateService -> VveRepo : save updated VVE
VveRepo -> VveDb : persist changes
UpdateService -> Audit : publish update event
Audit -> AuditTopic : VVE_UPDATED
Audit -> AuditDb : append audit record
UpdateService --> OemController : Updated DTO
OemController --> Client : 200 OK
Client --> Proxy : 200 OK
Proxy --> FrontService : DTO
FrontService --> UI : Response
UI --> Operator : Show warnings & confirmation

@enduml
